<!-- Example of Digital NOTAM for a heliport usage limitation change (helicopters with total mass >= 8t must submit a permission request at least 3 hrs in advance):
  
     Airport/Heliport: EAHG DONLON/DOWNTOWN HELIPORT
           Start Time: 2027-11-18 08:45
             End Time: 2027-11-18 16:00
      Limitation type: Conditional for
         Limitation 1: Operation: LANDING
                       Prior Permission: 3 HR
                       Prior Permission Details: permission is to be requested from heliport operator
                       Aircraft - type: HELICOPTER
                                - weight: 8 T
                                - weight interpretation: AT_OR_ABOVE
               Reason: -
                 Note: -
-->

